      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling very disconnected and questioning the reality of your experiences. It's not uncommon for people to feel this way sometimes, especially given our heavy reliance on technology. These feelings can be overwhelming. Talking to someone who can provide emotional support, such as a friend, family member, or mental health professional, might help you navigate and process these thoughts. Remember to take care of your mental health, even if it means taking a step back from the digital world for a while.",
      "source": "target",
